      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "REUBEN HILL (8) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by 2.25 lengths at this track in a handy 30.32 beating Ollie Reiko. Can make it back-to-back wins. PAR EXCELLENCE (4) was big odds last time but gave a huge sight after a fast early split, weakening late to finish a 4 length sixth (30.47) over 525m at this track. Can do much better this time. WANBI (7) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at Bendigo behind Kraken Ginger (28.31) in a Grade 5. Led around the bend before fighting on well and should give a sight. Leading chance. TIGER ROCKS (2) can measure up with the right run.",
